{"title":"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems\">2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) #3</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems\">2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) #5</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/0/0e0556cbdd068c4d1648d8884c3c3ed5ea034863.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times 4^2 - (8 \\div 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"126\" height=\"21\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/8/a283c258b8e473db8bce858f47150f0410f8cf34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 44 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 12 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 20 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 8 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 140$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"433\" height=\"18\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Following <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Order_of_operations\" title=\"Order of operations\">order of operations</a>, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/7/c4783e68f4e929d59eeb1154a31e9f8be9ec0fe1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times 4^2 - (8 \\div 2) = 3 \\times 4^2 - 4 = 3 \\times 16 - 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"335\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/1/031c0f3897f96bab46d9f20c7b0f9e3f33f41765.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=48 - 4 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 44}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"160\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem